{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:38:52+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-30T07:38:52+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Bachem Holding AG","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Biotechnology","country":"Switzerland","city":"Bubendorf","website":"https://www.bachem.com","employees":2725,"summary":"Bachem Holding AG, together with its subsidiaries, provides products for research, clinical development, and commercial application to pharmaceutical and biotechnology companies worldwide. It engages in the development, production, and regulatory support of peptide active pharmaceutical ingredients, such as peptide and oligonucleotide new chemical entities (NCEs). The company also offers commercial NCEs and generics; and project management, quality and regulatory, analytical, good manufacturing practice production, research grade production, and supply and vertical integration services. Bachem Holding AG was incorporated in 1971 and is headquartered in Bubendorf, Switzerland. Bachem Holding AG operates as a subsidiary of Ingro Finanz AG.","exchange":"Swiss","currency":"CHF","financial_currency":"CHF","summary_fr":"Bachem Holding AG, avec ses filiales, fournit des produits pour la recherche, le développement clinique et les applications commerciales aux sociétés pharmaceutiques et biotechnologiques du monde entier. Il s'engage dans le développement, la production et le soutien réglementaire d'ingrédients pharmaceutiques actifs peptidiques, tels que les nouvelles entités chimiques peptidiques et oligonucléotidiques (NCE). La société offre également des RCE et des génériques commerciaux, ainsi que des services de gestion de projet, de qualité et de réglementation, d'analyse, de production de bonnes pratiques de fabrication, de production de qualité recherche et d'approvisionnement et d'intégration verticale."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":6320812544,"shares_outstanding":7